  "title": "Refreshing Cucumber Salad",
  "description": "This cucumber salad is a quick-and-easy, throw-together salad that is both tangy and creamy. It's a refreshing way to use up some of your fresh garden veggies! Increase or decrease the amount of vinegar and mayonnaise to your liking.",
